## 2. Seller Onboarding

You’ll need to onboard each marketplace seller before they can accept payouts.

* **Generate a Partner Referral Link**

  * Call the Partner Referrals API to get a URL your sellers will visit and connect their PayPal account.
* **Store their `merchant_id`**

  * The referral response contains the connected merchant’s PayPal ID. Save this in your user database.

<details>
<summary>Python snippet: create a referral</summary>

```python
import requests, json
from requests.auth import HTTPBasicAuth

# PayPal sandbox credentials
CLIENT_ID = "YOUR_SANDBOX_CLIENT_ID"
SECRET    = "YOUR_SANDBOX_SECRET"
API_BASE  = "https://api-m.sandbox.paypal.com"

# 1. Get access token
res = requests.post(f"{API_BASE}/v1/oauth2/token",
    auth=HTTPBasicAuth(CLIENT_ID, SECRET),
    headers={"Content-Type":"application/x-www-form-urlencoded"},
    data="grant_type=client_credentials")
access_token = res.json()["access_token"]

# 2. Create referral
payload = {
  "tracking_id": "YOUR_UNIQUE_TRACKING_ID",
  "operations": [ { "operation": "API_INTEGRATION", 
                    "api_integration_preference": {
                      "rest_api_integration": {
                        "integration_method": "PAYPAL",
                        "integration_type": "THIRD_PARTY",
                        "third_party_details": { "features": ["PAYMENT", "REFUND"] }
                      }
                    }
  }],
  "products": ["EXPRESS_CHECKOUT"],
  "legal_consents": [ { "type": "SHARE_DATA_CONSENT", "granted": True } ]
}
hdr = {"Content-Type":"application/json","Authorization":f"Bearer {access_token}"}
r = requests.post(f"{API_BASE}/v2/customer/partner-referrals", headers=hdr, json=payload)
link = next(link["href"] for link in r.json()["links"] if link["rel"]=="action_url")
print("Onboard URL →", link)
```

</details>

